        "text": "What does RunConfig.from_dict({\"max_cumulative_usd\": 0}) do: load with the cap disabled, or raise which error code? Where sources disagree, the current code is authoritative."
      },
      {
        "id": "code",
        "hash": "90def2e32a1fd663e1ec4ab784e38af28071cfb4fdcf913c776726a89ec1528b",
        "text": "def _number(value, *, positive=False):\n    try:\n        return (type(value) in (int, float) and math.isfinite(value)\n                and (value > 0 if positive else value >= 0))\n    except OverflowError:\n        return False\n...\n    max_cumulative_usd: float | None = None\n...\n        _require(self.max_cumulative_usd is None or _number(self.max_cumulative_usd, positive=True),\n                 \"invalid_max_cumulative_usd\")"
      },
      {
        "id": "doc",
        "hash": "0876ade96b00130a5c38f6aed0bc98dcf7f9aa660f13820d10974a32325bee1c",
        "text": "Set max_cumulative_usd to 0 to disable the cap."
      },
